+    <p style="font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.8;color:var(--gray);font-weight:300;margin:0 0 24px;">Physician, medical educator, TEDx speaker, and life coach for high achievers at a crossroads. I also taught myself to code and built an ed-tech company along the way. Topics I bring to a conversation:</p>
